WEBVTT

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:31.760
ambapo tutashindanisha hadithi moja
dhidi ya nyingine.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:40.920
Hii mitindo tofauti niliyoyaongelea
usiku wa leo

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:47.616
ninafikiri ni muhimu
kutupatia njia

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:51.696
nje ya bwawa la ubaguzi wa rangi.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:56.656
Na nataka niongelee kuhusu
mtindo mwingine wa muhimu sana.

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.320
Na huo ni ukombozi.